## 🎨 Color Mode Reference

| Mode | Purpose | Primary Colors | Backgrounds |
|------|---------|-----------------|-------------|
| **Full RGB** | Digital, web, video | Cyan → Violet + Gold | Cosmic Navy, Black, or transparent |
| **CMYK** | Print (4-color) | Cyan, Magenta, Yellow, Black separations | White or cream stock |
| **Monochrome B/W** | Accessibility, print | Black or White | Opposite (W or B) |
| **Single Color** | Embroidery, stamping | Primary (Cyan) or Gold | Any contrasting background |
| **Duotone** | Modern design aesthetic | Cyan + Gold, or Violet + Gold | Dark or light backgrounds |

